@* 共用頁首：麵包屑（選用）、標題＋狀態標籤（選用）、副標題、右側操作按鈕（選用）。 *@

<header class="ia-page-header">
    <div class="ia-page-heading">
        @if (Breadcrumb is not null)
        {
            <div class="ia-crumb">@Breadcrumb</div>
        }
        <div class="ia-page-title-row">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h4" HtmlTag="h1" Class="ia-page-title">@Title</MudText>
            @TitleAddon
        </div>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Subtitle))
        {
            <p class="ia-page-sub">@Subtitle</p>
        }
        @SubtitleContent
    </div>

    @if (Actions is not null)
    {
        <div class="ia-page-actions">@Actions</div>
    }
</header>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Title { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Parameter] public string? Subtitle { get; set; }

    /// <summary>標題上方的麵包屑，例如「總覽 / 待覆核」。</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Breadcrumb { get; set; }

    /// <summary>緊接在標題右邊的內容，例如狀態徽章。</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? TitleAddon { get; set; }

    /// <summary>需要放連結或格式化文字的副標題（取代 Subtitle）。</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? SubtitleContent { get; set; }

    /// <summary>頁首右側的按鈕、搜尋框等。</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Actions { get; set; }
}
